<section>
    <h2>RESET and Demo</h2>
    <p>
        The red <strong>RESET Database</strong> button in the navigation bar
        drops and recreates all tables with their sample data by calling the
        <code>sp_load_foodmenudb()</code> stored procedure.
    </p>
    <p>
        To verify the RESET works: on the <a href="/menuItems">Menu Items</a>
        page, press <strong>Delete 'French Dip' (RESET demo)</strong> and watch
        French Dip disappear from the table, then press RESET and it comes back.
    </p>
</section>
